# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The shade guide was published as "Throwing Shade" on 2026-08-06 and renamed
# "Out of the Sun" on 2026-08-12. The old paths were indexed, so they get a real
# 301 rather than being left to 404. The splat covers /map/ and any future child
# route without needing a second rule to be remembered.
#
# Kept even after the old URLs drop out of the index: an inbound link from
# anywhere that saw the guide in its first week still has to land.
/guides/throwing-shade/*  /guides/out-of-the-sun/:splat  301
/guides/throwing-shade    /guides/out-of-the-sun/        301
